        "text": "Katie Ruebush",
        "text_sha256": "59932ee3731dd07403dfb79f0763902efe2a9f4852505a042df522932641cc3a",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Katie Ruebush, P.T., D.P.T.",
        "text_sha256": "8c29a4887ea56708f08f0a41475f66528dd42dcceda71f9db15bc9b265111380",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "About Katie Ruebush, P.T., D.P.T.",
        "text_sha256": "33a895dc5d42fe596cdcacbaddb24765bb67eddee2c99611707edcc3e76e0dbf",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Katie Ruebush is a women's health physical therapist specializing in pelvic floor and obstetric physical therapy. As a lifelong athlete and now mother, she enjoys helping clients reach their personal goals of returning to their activities of daily living, hobbies and exercise routines after injuries, surgeries or childbirth.",
        "text_sha256": "e91f6415ad015f4312916934d8b9ffca20454c7ee5edb3aaad2dd03ff0b5fc48",
        "word_count": 48
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Ruebush graduated with a doctorate of physical therapy from Washington University in St. Louis and completed a clinical rotation in women's health at Rush Hospital in Chicago, Illinois. She earned a B.S. in exercise science and a B.S. in human performance and fitness from St. Ambrose University in Davenport, Iowa, where she received the Major of the Year award.",
        "text_sha256": "b6fc075c829d2bd432555c7bfdc406f5bd481bd219a45a687273acb174533a94",
        "word_count": 59
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Ruebush is currently completing her M.B.A. from Louisiana State University.",
        "text_sha256": "b3fbc8acc531faff3671b2a88539f50c1870ca95f209234cab44e1cd7a2199b7",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Hospital affiliations",
        "text_sha256": "e6504e68d7e8e6b8187bc1b13e33b31f751fb7b365b27cf9f90691053f642ba2",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Ruebush currently sees patients in an OB/GYN clinic and obstetrical inpatients at Memorial Hospital in Carthage, Illinois.",
        "text_sha256": "ae724739dbc60efc1090d9ab3d729215c7405afe05451a4cef4879bf7d82e1ad",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Other relevant positions",
        "text_sha256": "3cb35bf4b505f1c9652a309bbf062b6c5ebff2ba01239bd968b9ac137f401f2b",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Ruebush is a member of the American Physical Therapy Association and the Academy of Pelvic Health Physical Therapy. She also enjoys creating online content for her business, Physio Pharm, and spending time with her husband and two sons on their family farm.",
        "text_sha256": "346317730563f3b21881cc50a24c2d35d7f8701f70fc5589c8030535eaef11f3",
        "word_count": 42
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "The educational health content on What To Expect is reviewed by our medical review board and team of experts to be up-to-date and in line with the latest evidence-based medical information and accepted health guidelines, including the medically reviewed What to Expect books by Heidi Murkoff. This educational content is not medical or diagnostic advice. Use of this site is subject to our terms of use and privacy policy . © 2005-2026 Everyday Health, Inc., a Ziff Davis company.",
        "text_sha256": "c423e7e136e9c8ebf39e668c5b1617d92d49cbd07ce74c8b1ec308c597fa3593",
        "word_count": 79
      },
      {
